d the coefficient of the cubic term is $a=-1,$ we can write the polynomial as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(x) & =a(x-{x}_{1})(x-{x}_{2})(x-{x}_{3}) \\\\  & =-1(x-(-2))(x-(3+\\text{i}))(x-(3-\\text{i})) \\\\  & =-(x+2)(x-(3+\\text{i}))(x-(3-\\text{i}))\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nExpanding the parentheses, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-(x+2)(x-(3+\\text{i}))(x-(3-\\text{i})) & = \\\\ -(x+2)({x}^{2}-x(3-\\text{i})-x(3+\\text{i})+(3+\\text{i})(3-\\text{i})) & = \\\\ -(x+2)({x}^{2}-6x+10) & = \\\\ -({x}^{3}-6{x}^{2}+10x+2{x}^{2}-12x+20) & = \\\\ -{x}^{3}+4{x}^{2}+2x-20 & .\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $f(x)=-{x}^{3}+4{x}^{2}+2x-20.$" 13194139534143 true] [17592186278515 1000 #edb/ref 17592186278516 13194139534143 true] [17592186278515 1000 #edb/ref 17592186278517 13194139534143 true] [17592186278515 1000 #edb/ref 17592186278518 13194139534143 true] [17592186278515 1000 #edb/ref 17592186278519 13194139534143 true] [17592186278515 1000 #edb/ref 17592186278520 13194139534143 true] [17592186278515 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534143 true] [17592186278515 1041 "selection" 13194139534143 true] [17592186278515 1104 #edb/ref 17592186278517 13194139534143 true] [17592186278515 1110 #uuid "80fba6b1-2db0-5303-820f-da06609dd2b9" 13194139534143 true] [17592186278516 1034 "{x}^{3}-2{x}^{2}+4x-10" 13194139534143 true] [17592186278516 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534143 true] [17592186278516 1111 #uuid "b5a45ed8-2813-5d60-9ff3-b09265015e45" 13194139534143 true] [17592186278517 1034 "-{x}^{3}+4{x}^{2}+2x-20" 13194139534143 true] [17592186278517 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534143 true] [17592186278517 1111 #uuid "43d6ed9e-848a-5fd1-bcb4-6ae1b774f1ad" 13194139534143 true] [17592186278518 1034 "-{x}^{3}+4{x}^{2}+2x+20" 13194139534143 true] [17592186278518 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534143 true] [17592186278518 1111 #uuid "7d0741fd-6970-52b4-95a4-fb9bbe6b628d" 13194139534143 true] [17592186278519 1034 "{x}^{3}-4{x}^{2}-2x+20" 13194139534143 true] [175