})(x-{x}_{2})(x-{x}_{3}) & =-5(x-0)(x-(-4))(x-7) \\\\  & =-5\\,x\\,(x+4)(x-7)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nExpanding the parentheses, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-5\\,x\\,(x+4)(x-7) & =-5\\,x\\,({x}^{2}-3x-28) \\\\  & =-5({x}^{3}-3{x}^{2}-28x) \\\\  & =-5{x}^{3}+15{x}^{2}+140x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $P(x)=-5{x}^{3}+15{x}^{2}+140x.$" 13194139534143 true] [17592186278553 1000 #edb/ref 17592186278554 13194139534143 true] [17592186278553 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534143 true] [17592186278553 1041 "field-1" 13194139534143 true] [17592186278553 1104 #edb/ref 17592186278554 13194139534143 true] [17592186278553 1110 #uuid "9d31d0b1-e5d7-569a-a5f3-d91ae28a7aab" 13194139534143 true] [17592186278554 1034 "-5" 13194139534143 true] [17592186278554 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534143 true] [17592186278554 1111 #uuid "ea7c6445-1e77-55a1-a103-fbf59b3ce0bc" 13194139534143 true] [17592186278555 1000 #edb/ref 17592186278556 13194139534143 true] [17592186278555 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534143 true] [17592186278555 1041 "field-2" 13194139534143 true] [17592186278555 1104 #edb/ref 17592186278556 13194139534143 true] [17592186278555 1110 #uuid "56daa1ba-5fa7-5531-a098-3a49bc93743a" 13194139534143 true] [17592186278556 1034 "15" 13194139534143 true] [17592186278556 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534143 true] [17592186278556 1111 #uuid "c0297766-a587-54e6-ab3e-f7609ca006f3" 13194139534143 true] [17592186278557 1000 #edb/ref 17592186278558 13194139534143 true] [17592186278557 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534143 true] [17592186278557 1041 "field-3" 13194139534143 true] [17592186278557 1104 #edb/ref 17592186278558 13194139534143 true] [17592186278557 1110 #uuid "7d781bba-bc03-5e45-85bd-d3afe7594ae5" 13194139534143 true] [17592186278558 1034 "140" 13194139534143 true] [17592186278558 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534143 true] [17592186278558 1111 #uuid "50f4fe9b-3ce3-5bdc-8a0f-8fc73e08122b" 13194139534143 true] [17592186278559 1017 #edb